      <data key="d1">"A Good Array is a subarray that is not a palindrome but can become one by modifying exactly one element, as defined by the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"A good array is defined as a non-palindromic array that can become a palindrome by modifying exactly one element. The student's code attempts to identify such arrays but contains errors."</data>
