    <node id="&quot;PALINDROME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Palindrome is an array that reads the same forwards and backwards, such as [12, 3, 12]."&lt;SEP&gt;"A palindrome is an array that reads the same forwards and backwards, such as [12,3,12]. The code must exclude such arrays from being counted as '好数组'."</data>
