    <node id="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"字符串外串 is a programming problem that involves determining whether a string of length n exists with a specific 'cute degree' m."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串是牛可乐提出的编程竞赛问题，要求判断是否存在满足特定条件的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串是牛可乐提出的问题，要求判断是否存在特定长度和可爱度的字符串并输出符合条件的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串是牛可乐提出的问题，要求判断是否存在特定长度和可爱度的字符串，并输出符合条件的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the programming problem centered around calculating the maximum 'cuteness' of a string based on specific substring and subsequence criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the programming problem defined by 牛可乐, involving calculating the 'cute degree' of a string based on specific substring and subsequence conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569</data>
    </node>
